# Render image build context (docker/Dockerfile, built from the repo root). Allowlist: only what a packet run needs.
# Left out on purpose: .git, .venv, .models (YuNet is fetched and sha-checked at build), .platform.json (a machine
# record from the host), tests, caches, and the sound effects (their Pixabay licence forbids redistribution, and an
# image is redistribution).
*
!SKILL.md
!scripts/
!looks/
!kits/
!assets/
!docker/requirements.lock
!docker/image_assets.py
assets/overlay-examples/
assets/template/assets/sfx/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
